{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:02fa86cb25e21540","name":"Elite Trooper","source":{"id":"source:reference-02fa86cb25e21540","title":"Elite Trooper","revision":25875,"timestamp":"2024-12-26T12:19:01Z","sha256":"757b61e30e65bd8dd8939c4e05cd5dbd4f065b6bf5bee48de219b2d4cd34a96c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25875","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Elite%20Trooper&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-02fa86cb25e21540","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Elite Trooper represents an individual who has received advanced combat training. More than a mere ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"},", the Elite Trooper is highly trained and capable of taking on any number of combat-related missions, such as guarding an important location, assaulting an enemy base, or participating in a stealthy insertion into enemy territory. They're a crack shot and, though trained in the use of armor, can easily operate without it if the situation warrants. When the fighting gets particularly brutal, the Elite Trooper can dispatch foes hand-to-hand as easily as they can with a blaster.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Elite Troopers exist in a variety of roles, but unlike Imperial ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stormtroopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stormtroopers"},"- the \"elite troops\" of the Empire, they rely on skill and ingenuity more than sheer force and blind obedience to the Empire's will. Thus, the best missions for them involve penetrating attacks deep behind enemy lines, or guerrilla warfare conducted on enemy-held worlds- situations where versatility and sheer determination are the Elite Trooper's best armaments and armor.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Examples of Elite Troopers in Star Wars:"]}," General Madine, Major Derlin, Kyle Katarn, Lieutenant Page, Kell Tainer, ARC Trooper Alpha-Ø2.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," To qualify to become an Elite Trooper, a character must fulfill the following criteria:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"},":"]}," +7"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"},":"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Proficiency (Light)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Proficiency_(Light)","referenceId":"reference:5c5fd1ac409e0220"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Proficiency (Medium)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Proficiency_(Medium)","referenceId":"reference:466f1c0788c7f68d"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_I","referenceId":"reference:e2ebb2bef3706adf"},", and either ",{"tag":"a","children":["Point-Blank Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Point-Blank_Shot","referenceId":"reference:7464dcbe8125c639"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flurry"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flurry","referenceId":"reference:db3c6f56a4dbe0df"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"},":"]}," At least one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"h